{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"Demetrius smiles. \"How are you feeling after the last few days?\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T00:20:26.662000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880245270535880714","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"Better.... kinda... its still so much to take in. Three weeks ago I was in a war zone and shattering. Two weeks ago I could barely look out a window. Ons week ago we made another deal. One week ago Willow Awoke. One week ago I made a deal with Death. Two days ago I store Death in the eye. Two days ago I died. Yesterday I was dead. Yesterday I ave- *helped* avenge myself.\" Eloise says counting in her fingers then adds in a soft whisper. \"Yesterday I heard things.\" Eloise shakes her head lightly \"Last night I *slept*, and today I'm here. Abd we're so close to my deadline and I'm not feeling *any* closer from a week ago despite Willow doing such an incredible job at the cafè.\" Eloise takes a deep breath and stops herself from rambling more. \"So much. Its just so much.\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T00:32:32.860000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880248316431069224","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"He nods. \"You've been through so much. But I know you are capable of meeting the deadline. You are quite smart, an excellent chef, and very resourceful. You have what it takes.\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T00:36:20.397000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880249270790389761","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"Eloise nods quietly. \"Its part of why *I* wanted to invite you to tea.\" Eloise says a bit playfully, but heart heart doesn't seem all in on it before taking a sip of the provided tea and closes her eyes to enjoy it. \"Lovely as always.\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T00:39:13.580000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880249997172551693","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"He nods. \"I know you can't give me any preview of the actual thing, but i would be honored to visit for a proper tea date.\" He smiles. Knowing Demetrius, 'date' here probably doesn't mean Eloise's first thought, but one can hope.","created_at":"2021-08-26T00:41:40.196000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880250612124626984","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
