{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"(Eloise was content to put of sight out of mind things, much as she'd done most of the war to date. Now that she's  here, and in the context of what all is happening, she's not sure how to start the conversation again.)","created_at":"2021-08-26T01:20:01.732000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880260265466269747","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"As they are working, Demetrius looks to Eloise. \"I used to think I'd never grow tired of fighting. I'm glad to know I was wrong. After this way is over, I don't want to fight another one ever again. I've seen far too many.\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T01:25:55.215000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880261748081442867","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"I can understand that... kinda... I fought so much as a kid. After coming here I didn't want to fight anymore, just focus on the cafè. After last night... I guess I didn't realize how much I missed it. But its still not something I want to do.\" Eloise has a lopsided smile on her face, to match the mixed emotions in her statement.","created_at":"2021-08-26T01:44:29.466000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880266421588860990","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"He nods. \"It's a weird way, to be caught between the comfort of familiarity and the regret that comes with growth. Hopefully we are both strong enough to stay the course towards our better selves, hmm?\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T01:49:22.750000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880267651711111278","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"Eloise nods. \"I think we are.  Not that its a thing to brag about but it wasn't until my last breath did I try to fight back. And even last night.. I was angry, but I fought to keep my word, not because of my anger.\" She gives a nervous laugh as she reflects.","created_at":"2021-08-26T02:01:16.933000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880270647211720704","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"I am glad. You are a good person, Eloise.\" He smiles and begins a small chant, as a thin bubble of force appears around a section of the park. He finishes and continues walking.","created_at":"2021-08-26T02:08:42.763000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880272517158293514","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"You are too Mister Demetrius.\" Eloise  replies smiling, walking with Demetrius, actively trying to walk along side him, but occasionally falling back to follow instead out of habit, before catching back up.","created_at":"2021-08-26T02:21:10.316000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880275652622815252","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"Demetrius reaches a point in the park and repeats th invocation, as a bubble of force projects out from his and moves to another part of the city.","created_at":"2021-08-26T02:28:20.529000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880277457066926141","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"He stretches his neck, before turning into his stag form. \"I feel like being this for now. Would you care for a ride?\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T02:29:03.377000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880277636784484392","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"O-Okay.\" Eloise gives a quick nod.","created_at":"2021-08-26T02:32:38.889000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880278540707323914","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
