{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"As you resist the urge, you notice that his fur texturally feels much softer than a normal deer and more like rose petals. He nods and continues moving along, sometimes walkign and sometimes flying in small bursts.","created_at":"2021-08-26T02:41:11.765000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880280691865165904","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"Eloise leans forward and wraps her arms against Demetrius to hold on, her face resting against his fur. \"It's not my place to ask... do you really feel like you deserved what happened?   Getting exiled? Your.... curse?\" She asks softly.","created_at":"2021-08-26T02:50:19.906000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880282990935171093","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"He sighs. \"I cannot say. The curse... is certainly poetic justice. I wish it had not happened, that I had been helped to a better path more gently. But I do not know for certain.\" He looks out as he wanders the park casting various spells. \"I do wish I could see my home again without pain.\" He smiles sadly.","created_at":"2021-08-26T03:20:17.650000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880290531220004914","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"Is there anything I can do to help you see it again..?\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T03:25:51.579000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880291931819761694","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"He sighs sadly as he slows down his walking. \"I do not know. The curse that pains me to do so is held intact by magic even beyond my means at the moment.\" He pauses for a few minutes. \"But you can certainly help make my time on this plane all the more enjoyable.\" He smiles.","created_at":"2021-08-26T03:31:10.836000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880293270880657460","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
